        { code: "TOP", name: "Top-up & Super Top-up", category: "specialized", description: "Top-up: Covers individual claims above deductible. Super Top-up: Covers aggregate claims above deductible in a year.", riskTransfer: "Activates after base policy/deductible is exhausted.", sellerResponsibilities: "Define deductible clearly; coordinate with base policy.", buyerResponsibilities: "Understand deductible vs base sum insured; maintain base cover.", notes: "Cost-effective way to increase coverage. Super Top-up is better as it aggregates all claims against deductible." }
